# Carevora

## AI-Powered Personalized Wellness Monitoring and Early Risk Detection System for Elderly Care Homes

Carevora is an AI-powered elderly-care support platform designed to assist caregivers in monitoring the emotional, cognitive, and metabolic well-being of elderly residents.

The system combines artificial intelligence, machine learning, conversational assessment, personalized risk prediction, explainable AI, and caregiver decision support within a unified web-based platform.

> **Note:** Carevora is intended to provide AI-assisted risk monitoring and caregiver decision support. It is not a medical diagnostic system and does not replace professional healthcare services.

---

## Research Project

**Project:** J26-IT-421  
**Degree:** B.Sc. (Hons) in Information Technology  
**Institution:** Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (SLIIT)

### Research Components

The Carevora platform consists of multiple research components:

1. **Emotional Wellness, Social Isolation and Loneliness Trajectory Prediction**
2. **Cognitive Wellness Monitoring and Early Cognitive Decline Prediction**
3. **Metabolic Health Risk Prediction**

The components are integrated through common application, AI/ML, database, authentication, and caregiver-support services.

---

# System Overview

Carevora follows a modular architecture where elderly residents provide assessment information through the application and the collected information is processed by the corresponding AI/ML component.

The overall workflow can be summarized as:

```text
Elderly Resident
       |
       v
AI-Assisted Assessment / Interaction
       |
       v
Data Collection
       |
       v
Feature Processing
       |
       v
AI / Machine Learning Services
       |
       +-------------------------------+
       |               |               |
       v               v               v
Emotional         Cognitive        Metabolic
Wellness          Wellness         Health
Component         Component        Component
       |               |               |
       +---------------+---------------+
                       |
                       v
              Risk Prediction
                       |
                       v
             Explainable Insights
                       |
                       v
          Personalized Recommendations
                       |
                       v
              Caregiver Dashboard
                       |
                       v
              Follow-up / Reassessment
